### 1. Δημιουργία Νέου Event (POST Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rock Concert 2026",
  "description": "Live music in Athens",
  "location": "OAKA Stadium",
  "dateTime": "2026-09-20T21:00:00",
  "totalSeats": 1000,
  "availableSeats": 99999
}

###

### Get all
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### Get one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/1